<title>USA: Nike Inc may issue $150 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Nike Inc may issue $150 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nike Inc is expected to issue $150 million in seven-year debt via lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co, syndicate sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to price one day next week, they added.</p>
<p>No further details were available on the deal.</p>
<p>--Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675</p>
</text>
